# Static Landing Page

A visually polished, responsive static landing page built to showcase foundational HTML5 and CSS3 layout techniques.

## Features
- **Sticky Navigation:** Fixed top header with smooth navigation links.
- **Hero Section:** Prominent headline, subheadline, and a call-to-action (CTA) button.
- **Content Sections:** Dedicated areas for features, product details, and user testimonials.
- **Responsive Design:** Mobile-friendly layouts built using CSS Flexbox and Grid.
- **Consistent Styling:** Unified color palette, clear typographic hierarchy, and clean layout spacing.

## Tech Stack
- HTML5
- CSS3
